+    /// Headers taken off testnet4, where header v2 activated at 149537.
+    ///
+    /// The published vectors are generated by the same C++ this module mirrors,
+    /// so on their own they only prove the translation faithful, not the reading
+    /// of the format correct. A live header is an independent oracle: the hash
+    /// is what the network agreed on. 149537 is the activation block itself,
+    /// 149538 chains onto it, and 169000 carries a non-zero `m_time_offset`
+    /// with the time-rolling flag clear.
